# Bilingual SEO Architecture (Permanent)

This project is **NOT** a translated bilingual website.

It is **TWO independent SEO websites** sharing one UI.

- English targets English Google search intent.
- Chinese targets Malaysian Chinese Google search intent.
- Both must compete independently in rankings.

## Never translate

- Never directly translate English paragraphs into Chinese.
- Never keep the same sentence structure.
- Never use AI-style literal translation.
- Chinese copy must be rewritten from scratch.

## Content parity only

Maintain: same page purpose, UI, user journey, features.

Do **NOT** maintain: same sentences, wording, paragraph order, or heading wording.

## Chinese SEO focus (MY Chinese)

Prefer natural clusters such as:

TPOWER / TPOWER线上博彩 / TPOWER官网 / TPOWER官方平台 / TPOWER官方网站 / TPOWER官方入口 / TPOWER下载 / TPOWER APP / TPOWER APK / TPOWER注册 / TPOWER优惠 / TPOWER登录 / 真人视讯 / 真人娱乐城（品类 SEO） / 老虎机 / 体育博彩 / 捕鱼游戏 / 网上博彩 / 手机博彩

Primary Chinese brand: **TPOWER线上博彩** (see `chinese-brand-positioning.mdc`). Do not default to TPOWER娱乐城.

## Headings & CTAs

Rewrite headings naturally for Chinese search intent.

CTA examples: 立即注册 / 立即下载 / 立即体验 / 领取优惠 / 马上开始 / 查看全部游戏 / 进入游戏大厅 / 进入TPOWER官方平台 / 查看更多优惠

## FAQ

Chinese FAQ must differ from English and mirror real Chinese queries:

TPOWER靠谱吗？ / TPOWER怎么注册？ / TPOWER怎么下载APP？ / TPOWER可以提现吗？ / TPOWER有哪些优惠？ / TPOWER支持哪些银行？ / TPOWER有真人视讯吗？ / TPOWER手机版怎么下载？

## Long-form

- Rewrite Chinese articles from scratch.
- Average paragraph: 50–90 Chinese characters.
- Avoid huge text blocks.
- Natural Malaysian Chinese wording.

## Workflow for every page

1. Build English first.
2. Create Chinese from scratch.
3. Research Chinese search intent.
4. Rewrite headings, CTA, FAQ, long-form.
5. Build a unique Chinese keyword cluster.

## Quality gate

English readers believe it was written in English.  
Chinese readers believe it was written in Chinese.  
Neither audience should be able to tell another language version exists.

Apply to every existing and future page without exception.
